<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 04:16:53 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>Alphabet 总裁露丝·波拉特 (Ruth Porat) 畅谈谷歌如何资助人工智能以取得长期胜利，以及未来面临的最大风险</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/google-ruth-porat-ai-spending-risks/</link><description>波拉特周一在《财富》杂志最具影响力女性峰会上证实，谷歌今年将在人工智能建设上花费约 2000 亿美元，而且高峰即将来临。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55586156863_1188fe499c_o-e1791861287489.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 01:20:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/google-ruth-porat-ai-spending-risks/</guid></item><item><title>“与代理人进行交易将成为常态”：加密货币创始人学会了爱——也害怕——人工智能</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/crypto-founders-ai-agentic-trading/</link><description>Blockaid 联合创始人伊多·本-纳坦 (Ido Ben-Natan) 表示：“我们正处于有史以来最忙碌的时期。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2298530025.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 02:05:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/crypto-founders-ai-agentic-trading/</guid></item><item><title>“如果你把脚从踏板上移开，你就会开始停滞不前”：女性担任首席高管的职位已经停滞不前，其原因超出了管道范围</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/women-ceo-board-roles-stagnated/</link><description>女性在最高管理层和董事会中的比例一直停滞在 30% 左右，这是十多年来女性在董事会中的比例首次下降。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55585769726_10a7411139_o.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 23:56:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/women-ceo-board-roles-stagnated/</guid></item><item><title>高管们表示，124万亿美元的巨额财富转移、女性企业家和退伍军人准备重塑金融格局</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/top-execs-say-124-trillion-great-wealth-transfer-women-entrepeneurs-veterans-changing-money-landscape/</link><description>女性正在迈入新的财富领域，她们希望其他女性监督她们的财富如何配置。非营利性女孩投资组织今年收到了 4,000 份申请。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55585867438_6727262dcf_o-e1791847753401.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 13 Oct 2026 00:02:37 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/top-execs-say-124-trillion-great-wealth-transfer-women-entrepeneurs-veterans-changing-money-landscape/</guid></item><item><title>苏珊·柯林斯的盟友花费 25,000 美元在俄勒冈版波特兰攻击她的对手：“他们甚至在地图上找不到它”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/susan-collins-allies-25000-attacking-rival-portland-oregon/</link><description>“祝你好运，让迈恩人相信，当你不知道他们住在哪个波特兰时，你知道什么对他们最好，”她的民主党竞争对手抨击道。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-481161063.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 21:51:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/susan-collins-allies-25000-attacking-rival-portland-oregon/</guid></item><item><title>《财富》AIQ 峰会：对话已从实验转向执行</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/aiq-summit-summary-wrap-from-experimentation-to-execution/</link><description>最强大的公司不仅仅是分发人工智能工具，而是重新设计工作流程、培养人才、加强治理和建立纪律。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/55563856820_e178c54b78_3k.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:04:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/aiq-summit-summary-wrap-from-experimentation-to-execution/</guid></item><item><title>独家：微软即将离任的科学总裁计划加入梅赛德斯 F1 车队担任人工智能顾问</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/microsoft-peter-lee-departing-science-president-plans-to-join-mercedes-f1-team-as-ai-advisor/</link><description>Peter Lee 在 Microsoft 工作了 16 年，塑造了其科学研究工作。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2089850298-e1791835878833.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:38:51 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/microsoft-peter-lee-departing-science-president-plans-to-join-mercedes-f1-team-as-ai-advisor/</guid></item><item><title>LinkedIn 正在试办一所学校，教员工如何成为自己的老板——无需学位</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/linkedin-piloting-academy-jobs-businesses/</link><description>随着人工智能重塑工作，LinkedIn 押注其“经济机会学院”将比其他文凭更重要&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2295116808-e1791840110696.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 21:31:44 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/linkedin-piloting-academy-jobs-businesses/</guid></item><item><title>达里奥·奇爱（Dario Strangelove），或者：我如何学会停止担忧并爱上人工智能炸弹</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/ai-doomsday-anxiety-fears-like-cold-war-nuclear/</link><description>你不需要天气预报员就能知道人工智能末日风向哪个方向吹。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-607392968-e1791826932930.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 20:26:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/12/ai-doomsday-anxiety-fears-like-cold-war-nuclear/</guid></item><item><title>Ancestry 的首席执行官表示，一位亿万富翁老板教他在休息室与员工共进午餐，这让他能够访问“未经过滤的信息”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/ancestry-ceo-career-advice-lunch-with-employees-break-room/</link><description>Ancestry 的霍华德·霍克豪瑟 (Howard Hochhauser) 表示，首席执行官们“陷入了这个泡沫”。苹果和多邻国的高管们也通过与员工分享面包来摆脱束缚。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Howard-RootsTech71-copy-e1791573464484.jpeg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 11:22:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/11/ancestry-ceo-career-advice-lunch-with-employees-break-room/</guid></item></channel></rss>